        CUSTOMER CHURN ANALYSIS – Power BI Project Summary
Problem:
The company was losing customers at an increasing rate but lacked insights into why customers were leaving. They needed a clear understanding of churn patterns and factors influencing customer attrition to take timely action.

Action:
I built an interactive Power BI dashboard that analyzed customer behavior and segmented users based on churn status. Key features include churn rate tracking, tenure analysis, service usage breakdown, and demographic filters (like gender, region, and contract type). I also used DAX to calculate critical KPIs and added visual cues (color indicators) for better decision-making.

Result:
The dashboard revealed that churn was highest among customers with month-to-month contracts and those using fewer services. This helped the business target at-risk segments with personalized offers and improve customer retention strategies—turning data into meaningful action.

